WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:03.650
Wealth, fame, power...

3
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.440
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.820
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, obtained everything the world has to offer.

5
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.360
attained this and everything else
the world had to offer.

6
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.820
And his dying words drove
countless souls to the seas.

7
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.660
What he said in his final moments drove countless souls to the seas.

8
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.660
You want my treasure?

9
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.700
You can have it!

10
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.450
Go ahead.

11
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.040
I left everything I gathered
together in one place.

12
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.660
Find it!

13
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.250
Everything is right where I left it!

14
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.250
Now you just have to find it!

15
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.750
These words lured
men to the Grand Line

16
00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:26.380
People set their sights on the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams.

17
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.920
in pursuit of dreams greater than
they'd ever dared to imagine!

18
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.630
The world has truly entered the Great Pirate Era!

19
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.850
This is the time known as
the Great Pirate Era!

20
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:35.640
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

21
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:41.440
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

22
00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.690
One Piece!

23
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.700
Compasses? Not for me. Left them all behind

24
00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:58.500
I'm headed out to sea, with my heart serving as guide

25
00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
Following the ancient map to the spot marked "X" reveals

26
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.760
Yeah, it's only legendary till someone proves it's real

27
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.710
When the world's got you down,

28
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.850
lean on your crew, they'll turn it around

29
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.190
Their biorhythm will carry you through

30
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.230
We're gonna make the most of it

31
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:31.400
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

32
00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:36.990
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

33
00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.040
Got some change to my name,

34
00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:43.250
and maybe you wanna be my friend?

35
00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:48.130
We are, we are on the cruise!

36
00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:49.760
WE ARE!

37
00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:55.350
<b>The Stalwart War Spear</b>

38
00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:51.470
[PATTY] Hey, man!

39
00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:52.590
[CARNE] You all right?

40
00:01:52.510 --> 00:01:53.760
Try to breathe.

41
00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:55.510
You need a little fresh air.

42
00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:58.810
You want a pillow or maybe some water?

43
00:01:58.810 --> 00:02:00.140
Speak!

44
00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:03.190
This is bad.

45
00:02:03.190 --> 00:02:04.060
You know what?

46
00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:06.020
I make a great banana pudding. Want some?

47
00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:08.070
You idiot, we don't want
him to choke to death

48
00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:09.610
on any of your culinary disasters!

49
00:02:09.610 --> 00:02:10.990
Better that, than the trots he'd get

50
00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:13.110
from choking down one of
your raunchy meat pies!

51
00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:16.780
The reason I won't feed him one of my
meat pies, is because after one bite,

52
00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:19.240
he'd think he'd died
and gone to heaven!

53
00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:20.080
[BOTH yelling]

54
00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:21.620
Don't die yet!

55
00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:25.960
Well, this isn't good.

56
00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:27.040
We're in trouble.

57
00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.250
No, that was just luck!

58
00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:31.840
Don Krieg is gonna get up and
kick his ass any minute now.

59
00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:32.720
Just watch!

60
00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:34.630
I hope he's dead.

61
00:02:35.890 --> 00:02:36.890
So, boy.

62
00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:41.270
It's not your funeral,
yet, is it? Too bad.

63
00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:47.690
[KRIEG] Because one of us has gotta go.

64
00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:50.070
And since I'm here...

65
00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:53.900
I'd really like to pay my respects!

66
00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:56.950
Go to hell!

67
00:02:56.950 --> 00:02:57.780
[KRIEG grunts]

68
00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:59.740
[LUFFY] You first!

69
00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:00.910
[KRIEG groans]

70
00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.200
[PIRATES yelling]

71
00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.910
[PIRATE Z] This can't be happening!

72
00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:06.920
He's taken another fall!

73
00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:10.250
But... But how?

74
00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:11.460
I've never seen anyone hit him,

75
00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:14.630
because their usually dead
before they get close enough.

76
00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:19.220
The fact is... He might
not actually be invincible.

77
00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:20.050
[gulps]

78
00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:22.390
[PIRATE B] What the hell are you?!

79
00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:25.440
Look at that!

80
00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:26.730
The kid's pretty good.

81
00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:29.520
Yeah, no kidding!

82
00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:30.770
He's amazing!

83
00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:32.360
Finish him off, chore boy!

84
00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:34.690
Yeah! End it once and for all!

85
00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:38.200
That punk is fighting with Don Krieg
as if he were the same strength!

86
00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:41.240
This can't be real. It's like
I'm watching my own nightmare.

87
00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:43.240
He's supposed to be truly invincible.

88
00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:46.290
If he gets beaten by this little kid,
his reputation will be completely...

89
00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:48.670
Shut up, maggots! Never doubt me!

90
00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.090
What... was that?

91
00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:03.560
[PIRATE B] Finally, he's gonna stop
messing around and step up his game.

92
00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:06.140
[PIRATE C] The Mighty Battle Spear!

93
00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:09.150
What was that? An exploding spear?

94
00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:10.020
Now what?

95
00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:13.400
You gonna try to hide from me?

96
00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:14.690
All right then, boy.

97
00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:16.650
This should be fun.

98
00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:17.820
My Mighty Battle Spear.

99
00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:20.410
It's different from the one
I was fighting with earlier.

100
00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:21.320
When this thing hits you,

101
00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:29.120
you won't just be wounded and flailing,
you will be blown straight into Hell!

102
00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.000
[KRIEG yells]

103
00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:30.710
[LUFFY screams]

104
00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:33.130
That's not a normal spear.

105
00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:34.340
[LUFFY] Whoa, whoa,
whoa, not in the water!

106
00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:35.800
Not in the water! [grunts]

107
00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:37.380
That spear really sucks!

108
00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:41.260
It explodes every time
he hits anything.

109
00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:43.390
[LUFFY gasps]
What's going on?

110
00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:46.560
My knees...

111
00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:48.810
He's lost way too much blood.

112
00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:50.850
He can't fight for much longer.

113
00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:52.940
This better end quickly.

114
00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:56.070
You look tired, too bad.

115
00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:58.780
Guess you should've saved
a little more energy.

116
00:04:58.780 --> 00:04:59.990
[LUFFY] Damn.

117
00:04:59.990 --> 00:05:05.450
With everything rocking,
I can't hit him with full force.

118
00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:09.830
I've never in my life seen a more stunning
weapon than The Mighty Battle Spear.

119
00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:12.880
Don Krieg is the only one strong
enough to handle the spear,

120
00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:16.340
since the harder he strikes with it,
the bigger the explosion it causes.

121
00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:19.970
Anyone else would just be completely
destroyed by their own pathetic attempt.

122
00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:21.050
– [KRIEG yells]
– [LUFFY grunts]

123
00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:25.890
[KRIEG, LUFFY grunting]

124
00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:27.010
It's strength...

125
00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:28.560
His strength is the key.

126
00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:31.100
He causes the kind of
damage no one else can

127
00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.190
'cause there's just no one
else who can swing a spear

128
00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:35.520
that easily weighs more than a ton.

129
00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:39.860
[PIRATE J] That's exactly why Don Krieg
is the most dangerous man in the East Blue!

130
00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:44.620
[KRIEG, LUFFY grunting]

131
00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:47.290
[LUFFY yelping]

132
00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:48.080
[KRIEG yells]

133
00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.080
[LUFFY yells]

134
00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.960
[KRIEG growls]

135
00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:53.080
Now, die!

136
00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.210
[LUFFY, KRIEG grunt]

137
00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:55.330
Chore boy, look out!

138
00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.340
[PATTY, CARNE gasps]

139
00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:59.550
Phew... that was really close.

140
00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:04.050
[KRIEG growls]

141
00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:06.390
[KRIEG] You're just like a little bug!

142
00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:07.140
[KRIEG yells]

143
00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:18.820
Chore Boy!

144
00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.580
That's rough.

145
00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:37.590
[KRIEG] Heh. I'm not finished with you.

146
00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:42.260
If you hadn't made me so angry,
I would have killed you more quickly.

147
00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:43.090
Damn it.

148
00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:47.260
There's no way that Chore Boy
can take much more of this.

149
00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:49.220
That spear is way too powerful.

150
00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.140
No, you're wrong.

151
00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:52.850
Even with a hundred
thousand more weapons,

152
00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:57.650
our Chore boy can still bring him to his
knees, because he does not know fear.

153
00:06:59.570 --> 00:07:01.360
[KRIEG yelling]

154
00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.160
[KRIEG] Heh. That was too easy.

155
00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:28.140
[KRIEG] Now that's impressive.

156
00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:39.060
Stand or fall... Life or death...

157
00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:41.110
In a struggle for your very existence,

158
00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:45.110
you cannot have even the slightest
bit of fear, or you will be lost.

159
00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.700
What are you talking about?

160
00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.320
That kid out there...

161
00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:51.660
[KRIEG, LUFFY yelling]

162
00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:01.590
When he's fighting...

163
00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:07.010
[ZEFF] He's not afraid of anything!

164
00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:10.010
Not even death!

165
00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.390
[KRIEG growls]

166
00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:13.220
[KRIEG yells]

167
00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:16.020
[LUFFY yelling]

168
00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:18.230
[LUFFY groaning]

169
00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:24.820
Is it just instinct, or all a plan?

170
00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:30.660
We'll know soon, if he lives.

171
00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:33.330
[SANJI gasps]

172
00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:36.500
[SANJI] What plan? Killing himself?

173
00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:49.090
You... son of a bitch.

174
00:08:51.890 --> 00:08:52.720
[LUFFY] Heh!

175
00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.390
[COOKS cheering]

176
00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:55.850
[COOK J] Way to go Chore Boy!

177
00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:58.930
– [COOK K] Do it again!
– [COOK L] Kick his ass!

178
00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:05.020
I told you, today is your funeral!

179
00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:07.030
I am invincible!

180
00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:23.580
There is no doubt that Krieg
and his pirates are strong,

181
00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:26.800
But Chore Boy has something
they'll never have.

182
00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:36.760
[ZEFF] Krieg may have more pirates
at his command than anyone else before him,

183
00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:43.350
he may have terrible weapons that cause
mass destruction to everything in his path,

184
00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:47.570
but he will never
have that kid's heart.

185
00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:51.740
[SANJI gasps]

186
00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:56.280
[LUFFY grunts]

187
00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:58.450
[KRIEG] Huh? What?!

188
00:09:58.450 --> 00:09:59.830
My Battle Spear!

189
00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.660
What the hell did you do?!

190
00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:12.260
I just punched it in
the head five times.

191
00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:15.260
It looks tired, maybe it needs a rest.

192
00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:17.220
[KRIEG growling]

193
00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:20.350
[LUFFY] Now, it's my turn.

194
00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:26.690
Now that your little toy's
broken, you're nothing to me.

195
00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:28.940
[KRIEG grunts]
Oh yeah?

196
00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:29.860
[LUFFY] Yeah.

197
00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:33.780
Without the blade, it's just a bomb
on a stick and let's face it,

198
00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:35.030
that's pretty lame.

199
00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:36.030
[KRIEG] You think so?

200
00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:37.320
[LUFFY] Sure do!

201
00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:42.080
[KRIEG] Heh. Fine, so what if
it is just a bomb on a stick?

202
00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:44.500
You're in sad shape, kiddo.

203
00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:47.250
I think it'll be more than
enough to blow you to pieces.

204
00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:51.710
Ya know, it sounds to me like this is
some sort of pathetic attempt at a bluff.

205
00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:53.420
Okay, but you're wrong.

206
00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:57.550
Chore Boy's pretty good, huh?

207
00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:00.260
He might be able to pull it off.

208
00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:01.850
This is terrible!

209
00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:04.390
He just shattered the
Mighty Battle Spear!

210
00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:09.820
[SANJI grunting]

211
00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:13.280
It's a miracle he's still alive
after that many explosions.

212
00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:14.860
There's no way he can hold up!

213
00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:18.120
Just give up.

214
00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:19.780
Your defeat is imminent.

215
00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:22.490
You see, when you defied me...

216
00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:25.000
You signed your own death warrant!

217
00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:26.750
Nuh-uh!

218
00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:28.420
[KRIEG yells]

219
00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:29.420
[LUFFY, KRIEG grunt]

220
00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:31.250
[LUFFY] Hey! Up here!

221
00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:33.760
Bastard.

222
00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:35.420
You monkey!

223
00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:37.430
[LUFFY gibbers]

224
00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:43.430
Bounce outta that!

225
00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:47.730
[LUFFY grunts]

226
00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:48.600
[LUFFY yells]

227
00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:49.980
Nice try!

228
00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:56.030
How many weapons does that guy have?

229
00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:03.370
[chuckles]

230
00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:08.250
Now, Gum-Gum...

231
00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:10.000
... Gatling!

232
00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:24.010
[KRIEG] Weakling!

233
00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:26.850
What exactly did you
expect to happen, Boy?

234
00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:28.890
I'm wearing Wootz Steel Body Armor.

235
00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.810
This stuff is practically
indestructible!

236
00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:33.020
[LUFFY inhales]

237
00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:33.900
[LUFFY yells]

238
00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:34.940
We'll see about that!

239
00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:36.650
Gum-Gum Pistol!

240
00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:45.540
[PIRATES] Don!

241
00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:48.040
[grunting]

242
00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:50.750
[KRIEG] How dare you!

243
00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:54.130
[LUFFY yells]

244
00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:55.130
[LUFFY grunts]

245
00:12:55.130 --> 00:12:56.920
[chuckles]

246
00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:00.510
It's useless. You'll never defeat me!

247
00:13:00.510 --> 00:13:03.260
This armor could take a million
more of your monkey punches

248
00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.390
and it wouldn't have so much as a dent!

249
00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:08.060
[LUFFY grunts]

250
00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:10.940
Well, we'll just see about that.

251
00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.060
[gasps]

252
00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:13.860
[LUFFY] He's gone!

253
00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:17.070
[KRIEG] I'm right here!

254
00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:22.200
[LUFFY gasps]

255
00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:23.950
[KRIEG] You don't stand a chance, Boy!

256
00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:26.040
Real power comes from deadly weapons.

257
00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:28.830
They're the source of true strength!

258
00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:31.830
See, only the strong are meant to live.

259
00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.790
And that's me!

260
00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:37.050
[LUFFY grunting]

261
00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:39.840
Yeah? That's what you think!

262
00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:41.970
Gum-Gum...

263
00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:44.300
Heh. It's useless!

264
00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:47.390
Foolish pride will only get you so far!

265
00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:53.730
... Bazooka!

266
00:13:58.860 --> 00:14:01.490
[grunting]

267
00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:05.320
[laughing] That's it?

268
00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:09.200
After all that big talk,
that's all you've got? Ha, ha!

269
00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:11.040
[KRIEG] Huh? No!

270
00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:13.830
I don't believe it,
my armor's cracking!

271
00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:16.210
[grunting]

272
00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:18.170
[KRIEG] Heh! Doesn't matter.

273
00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:21.220
You're done for, chore boy!

274
00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:28.390
It's a trap! Get out!

275
00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:39.610
Chore Boy!

276
00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:41.940
[COOKS screaming]

277
00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.200
[PIRATES screaming]

278
00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:55.790
[ZEFF] He's not afraid of anything.

279
00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:58.790
Not even death.

280
00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:01.420
Is it just instinct, or all a plan?

281
00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:02.970
[ZEFF laughs]

282
00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:05.970
We'll know soon, if he lives.

283
00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:08.550
[LUFFY] Gum-Gum...

284
00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:11.310
What the...

285
00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:12.930
[yelling]

286
00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:14.560
[LUFFY] ... Bazooka!

287
00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:16.810
[KRIEG yells]

288
00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:18.560
[KRIEG grunting]

289
00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:21.110
[LUFFY grunting]

290
00:15:21.110 --> 00:15:24.280
[KRIEG groans]

291
00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:28.030
[KRIEG yells]

292
00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:30.450
[PIRATES shout]

293
00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:41.340
[COOKS cheer]

294
00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:43.960
– [COOK A] All right!
– [COOK L] Way to go chore boy!

295
00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:46.800
[KRIEG groaning]

296
00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:49.800
I totally win!

297
00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:55.100
[KRIEG] This isn't over yet, Boy!

298
00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:57.940
Whoa, he's alive!

299
00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:59.560
[LUFFY grunts]

300
00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:00.810
[LUFFY] Oh, no!

301
00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:02.610
[LUFFY grunting]

302
00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:06.280
[KRIEG laughing]
You can't escape!

303
00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:07.910
It's a steel net!

304
00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:10.120
[laughs]

305
00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:12.280
[LUFFY grunting]

306
00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:14.370
[SANJI gasps]

307
00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:19.120
[KRIEG laughs]

308
00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:22.920
It's over! That's the ocean
down there below us!

309
00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:26.670
It looks like I'll be getting
the last laugh after all, Chore Boy!

310
00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:32.100
– [PIRATES cheering]
– [PIRATE E] Take him down Don!

311
00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:33.760
[PIRATE F] Make that little brat pay!

312
00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:35.270
[PIRATE G] Yeah, get him!

313
00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:39.270
[LUFFY grunts]

314
00:16:39.270 --> 00:16:42.190
Now, I got that jerk
right where I want him!

315
00:16:42.190 --> 00:16:45.860
[SANJI] He hasn't even flinched.

316
00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:47.990
How can he stay so calm?

317
00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:52.660
[LUFFY] Time for me
to end this, right now!

318
00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:58.250
[KRIEG yelping]

319
00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.040
Now, Gum-Gum...

320
00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:13.930
... Giant Hammer!

321
00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:16.430
[KRIEG grunts]

322
00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:19.980
[groaning]

323
00:17:19.980 --> 00:17:22.190
[chuckles]

324
00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:23.480
[PIRATES gasp]

325
00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.610
[COOKS gasp]

326
00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:26.610
[gasps]

327
00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:36.660
– [COOKS cheer]
– [PIRATE CC] No!

328
00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:38.500
Don Krieg was defeated!

329
00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:41.160
[PIRATE J] How could this have happened?!

330
00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:43.210
[COOK L] You're awesome, Chore Boy!

331
00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:45.790
[COOK M] Yeah, you kicked his ass!

332
00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:49.300
– [CARNE laughs]
– He won! He really won!

333
00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:51.680
Oh, wow!

334
00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:52.800
I gotta be dreamin'!

335
00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:54.640
That's Don Krieg we're talking about!

336
00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:57.760
[PATTY] I know! Who'd a thought
that kid had it in 'im?

337
00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:58.890
[PATTY laughs]

338
00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:01.020
[GHIN] What is it? What's going on?

339
00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:03.230
Hey! Rise and shine!

340
00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:04.150
Krieg was beaten!

341
00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:06.480
Betcha you never thought
you'd see the day!

342
00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:07.480
What?!

343
00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:19.200
[SANJI gasps]

344
00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:25.130
Are you done daydreaming, yet?

345
00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:26.960
Go on, save that kid!

346
00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:28.420
[SANJI] Huh?

347
00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.260
[ZEFF] He can't swim!

348
00:18:30.260 --> 00:18:31.260
What?

349
00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:33.220
[ZEFF] Those with the power
of the devil fruit

350
00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:36.800
are hated by the sea, so they
lose their ability to swim.

351
00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.970
What're you sayin'? He'll just sink?!

352
00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:40.140
You could've told me that sooner,

353
00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:43.890
you worthless old geezer!
What if it's already too late?!

354
00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:16.800
[SANJI] Hey! Hang in there!

355
00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:19.850
[SANJI] You said you wouldn't die.

356
00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:22.770
You truly believe that, right?

357
00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:24.850
Well?!

358
00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:28.440
[LUFFY] You'll have
to do better than that...

359
00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:31.190
... if you want to beat me.

360
00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:37.320
Because, I don't think it's
time for me to die just yet.

361
00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:39.030
[SANJI] These guys...

362
00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:48.920
Zoro!

363
00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:51.340
[SANJI] How this fight would
end was clear from the start.

364
00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:52.960
Why choose death?

365
00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:57.680
Don't be stupid! Give up
your ambition and live!

366
00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:08.150
[SANJI] They're all...

367
00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:24.620
[ZORO] I don't know...
but, I will not run.

368
00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:30.210
Even if I retreat a single step, I would
be shattering the promises I've made.

369
00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:31.170
I can't run.

370
00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:33.000
I would lose my honor.

371
00:20:33.880 --> 00:20:38.300
You see, without that, there would
be nothing left for me, here.

372
00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:41.390
[ZEFF] Even with a hundred
thousand more weapons,

373
00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:46.730
our chore boy can still bring him to his
knees, because he does not know fear.

374
00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:51.350
Krieg may have more pirates at his
command, he may have terrible weapons

375
00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:55.860
that cause mass destruction
to everything in his path,

376
00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:05.700
[SANJI] Hey, Chore Boy,
don't you die on me!

377
00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:08.160
– [PIRATES whimper]
– [PIRATE G] Don! Are you okay?!

378
00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:11.120
[PIRATE H] Please, tell us it's an act!

379
00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:13.500
[GHIN] Don Krieg has been defeated.

380
00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:15.460
This can't be happening.

381
00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:18.220
He's the mighty rule of the East Blue.

382
00:21:18.220 --> 00:21:20.300
[PATTY] Yeah? Well, now
he's down for the count!

383
00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:22.390
Have a look at him
and see for yourself!

384
00:21:22.390 --> 00:21:24.810
[CARNE] That fancy armor
of his got all busted up,

385
00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:27.140
and he was out as soon
as he hit the deck!

386
00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:29.060
What? Do you think we're lying to ya'?

387
00:21:29.060 --> 00:21:30.810
Go ahead and look!

388
00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:31.730
[GHIN gasping]

389
00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:35.070
He was the only man
I ever really admired.

390
00:21:35.070 --> 00:21:37.690
How foolish, now he's lost.

391
00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:40.400
[GHIN coughs]

392
00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:42.360
[groans]

393
00:21:44.870 --> 00:21:46.620
[PATTY] Hey! Hold on!

394
00:21:46.620 --> 00:21:49.040
If you move now, the poison'll set in!

395
00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:51.160
[CARNE] Be still!
It's for your own good!

396
00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:55.460
Chore Boy, can you hear me?!

397
00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:56.630
Don't die!

398
00:21:56.630 --> 00:22:00.420
You still have a lot of
things to do with your life!

399
00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:01.840
Please don't die!

400
00:22:10.310 --> 00:22:12.190
Are you kidding?

401
00:22:13.900 --> 00:22:15.150
You really are something else.

402
00:22:15.150 --> 00:22:17.900
[KRIEG] No! I'm the strongest!

403
00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:20.570
I win! I'm the greatest!

404
00:22:20.570 --> 00:22:21.860
I'm the best!

405
00:22:21.860 --> 00:22:24.410
No one defeats me!

406
00:22:24.410 --> 00:22:26.120
No! Just stay down!

407
00:22:26.120 --> 00:22:28.660
Stop him! He's not even conscious!

408
00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:30.830
[KRIEG yelling]

409
00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:33.750
– [PIRATE J] Please Don, stop!
– [PIRATES yell]

410
00:22:33.750 --> 00:22:36.590
I have to win! I have to!

411
00:22:36.590 --> 00:22:39.090
[PIRATES shout]

412
00:22:39.090 --> 00:22:44.590
– [KRIEG yells]
– [PIRATES scream]

413
00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:47.180
[KRIEG howling]

414
00:22:47.180 --> 00:22:48.970
Kill!

415
00:22:48.970 --> 00:22:50.810
Enemy!

416
00:22:50.810 --> 00:22:52.980
[KRIEG yells]

417
00:22:52.980 --> 00:22:56.150
I'll fight until victory is mine!

418
00:22:56.150 --> 00:22:58.770
[KRIEG groans]

419
00:23:01.820 --> 00:23:03.570
[GHIN] Don Krieg...

420
00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:06.200
We lost.

421
00:23:06.200 --> 00:23:08.490
[PIRATES] Commander?

422
00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:12.000
[GHIN] Let's leave now, while we
still have a shred of dignity.

423
00:23:14.790 --> 00:23:17.580
Thanks for everything, Sanji.

424
00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:21.630
[SANJI] Sure, now leave
and don't ever come back.

425
00:23:21.630 --> 00:23:23.380
[GHIN] Hey, Sanji.

426
00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:28.050
You don't owe me any favors,
but when the kid wakes up...

427
00:23:28.050 --> 00:23:31.260
[LUFFY snoring]

428
00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:34.600
[GHIN] Tell him I said I'll
see him on the Grand Line.

429
00:23:35.690 --> 00:23:37.350
[SANJI] But, you...

430
00:23:37.350 --> 00:23:39.770
That's where I wanna go
with the time I have left.

431
00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:41.110
It's the only thing I care about.

432
00:23:41.110 --> 00:23:43.110
The only thing that keeps me going.

433
00:23:43.110 --> 00:23:45.950
Heh. It would seem that
Don Krieg's obsession

434
00:23:45.950 --> 00:23:48.950
with the Grand Line, has
become mine as well.

435
00:23:48.950 --> 00:23:54.160
[coughing]

436
00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:55.620
It's silly...

437
00:23:55.620 --> 00:23:57.120
I know that.

438
00:23:57.120 --> 00:23:59.580
But, it's my dream.

439
00:23:59.580 --> 00:24:04.260
With this poison in my veins,
I may only have a few hours to live.

440
00:24:04.260 --> 00:24:06.930
But, I feel free somehow,

441
00:24:06.930 --> 00:24:12.060
like now I can live those last
few moments on my own terms.

442
00:24:12.060 --> 00:24:15.350
[snoring]

443
00:24:15.350 --> 00:24:18.270
[PATTY, CARNE panting]

444
00:24:18.270 --> 00:24:20.730
[GHIN] To hell with loyalty to Don Krieg.

445
00:24:20.730 --> 00:24:25.940
My devotion to him was just an escape
from forging my own destiny.

446
00:24:26.860 --> 00:24:30.070
Once you heart is set,
and you pursue all your dreams

447
00:24:30.070 --> 00:24:32.580
with every last fiber of what you are,

448
00:24:32.580 --> 00:24:35.580
you will never again feel lost,
or hopeless, or afraid.

449
00:24:35.580 --> 00:24:38.580
I learned all that from
a brave chore boy.

450
00:24:43.090 --> 00:24:44.590
Hey, you guys!

451
00:24:44.590 --> 00:24:46.800
Give him the boat we use
to go grocery shopping!

452
00:24:46.800 --> 00:24:49.220
C'mon! Are you stupid or somethin'?!

453
00:24:49.220 --> 00:24:52.600
Why do we have to give a perfectly
good boat to a bunch of pirates?

454
00:24:52.600 --> 00:24:56.140
And what's gonna happen to all
our grocery shopping, Jackass?

455
00:24:56.140 --> 00:24:59.640
Patty's right. Let 'em swim
wherever they're goin' to!

456
00:24:59.640 --> 00:25:03.650
Go get that grocery boat, now!

457
00:25:03.650 --> 00:25:05.570
[PATTY, CARNE sob]

458
00:25:05.570 --> 00:25:07.190
All right, fine.

459
00:25:07.190 --> 00:25:09.320
Stop shouting.

460
00:25:09.320 --> 00:25:13.070
[PATTY, CARNE] Okay,
okay, we'll go get it!

461
00:25:19.830 --> 00:25:23.330
– [PIRATES yelling, grumbling]
– [PIRATE J] It's gonna sink!

462
00:25:36.180 --> 00:25:37.720
[GHIN] Why did I hesitate?

463
00:25:37.720 --> 00:25:39.730
What was I so worried about?

464
00:25:39.730 --> 00:25:43.150
When I think about it,
I can't help but feel stupid.

465
00:25:43.150 --> 00:25:48.230
– [LUFFY snoring]
– [GHIN, SANJI] Huh?

466
00:25:48.230 --> 00:25:52.240
[snoring continues]

467
00:25:52.240 --> 00:25:53.240
[GHIN] Hm.

468
00:25:54.700 --> 00:25:55.700
[SANJI] Heh.

469
00:25:57.660 --> 00:25:59.080
[GHIN] Well then.

470
00:25:59.080 --> 00:26:00.660
We gratefully accept this boat.

471
00:26:00.660 --> 00:26:03.750
Am I right to assume there's
no need to return it?

472
00:26:03.750 --> 00:26:05.000
[SANJI] It's yours.

473
00:26:05.000 --> 00:26:06.590
Don't ever come back here.

474
00:26:06.590 --> 00:26:07.840
Not for anything.

475
00:26:07.840 --> 00:26:09.340
Not even to return this boat.

476
00:26:09.340 --> 00:26:10.760
[PATTY] He's right!

477
00:26:10.760 --> 00:26:15.180
And don't you ever forget, this is
the restaurant where the cooks fight!

478
00:26:15.180 --> 00:26:16.010
The Baratie!

479
00:26:16.010 --> 00:26:19.520
[GHIN] Heh. The cooks
there sure mean business.

